eeps the claim about availability rather than safety; the target's Config comment documents the checks as best-effort with false negatives, so what the receipts add is that the consequence is a panic the applying node cannot avoid while following its duty; and the election-to-stale-state path remains source-argued, the decoded range is capped at eight entries, the harness recovers the panic, and storage faults, other cluster sizes and a rejecting leader are still outside the event set.\"}"}}
